{"id":"4c29bc243249e127","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_CSolve.md","title":"CSolve","display":"CSolve","type":"system","metadata":{"tags":["ZFC","normative-formula"],"macro_name":"CSolve","parameters":["E"],"formula_kind":"relational_abbreviation"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"tags","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>ZFC</span><span>normative-formula</span></div>"},{"key":"macro_name","html":"CSolve"},{"key":"parameters","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>E</span></div>"},{"key":"formula_kind","html":"relational_abbreviation"}],"html":"\n<p>定义组：Curry 简单类型算法。有序参数：<code>E</code>。</p>\n<p>枚举有限 U 的所有划分：构造子无冲突、箭头分解一致、商依赖图无环。不是语义 oracle。</p>\n<h2 id=\"规范公式\">规范公式</h2>\n<p><code>(@ CSolve E)</code> 按 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f625c6fc1945e22e\" href=\"?note=f625c6fc1945e22e\" title=\"000_ZFC/01_language\">无捕获缩写规则</a> 展开为下列有限公式。参数只取集合，不能填入函数项或元语言公式。</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-zfc\">(exists U\n  (exists R\n    (exists G\n      (and\n        (@ CNodes E U)\n        (and\n          (@ EquivOn U R)\n          (and (@ Subset E R) (and (@ CCompatible U R) (and (@ CDependency U R G) (@ ConverseWF U G)))))))))\n</code></pre>\n<h2 id=\"直接依赖\">直接依赖</h2>\n<p><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"1d04af639b3dad64\" href=\"?note=1d04af639b3dad64\" title=\"ZFC_CCompatible\">CCompatible</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"7fc9cbab4b5fcca5\" href=\"?note=7fc9cbab4b5fcca5\" title=\"ZFC_CDependency\">CDependency</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"76efdf35dc96e34a\" href=\"?note=76efdf35dc96e34a\" title=\"ZFC_CNodes\">CNodes</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"3695560d61c84d4f\" href=\"?note=3695560d61c84d4f\" title=\"ZFC_ConverseWF\">ConverseWF</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"170e22e2feddb645\" href=\"?note=170e22e2feddb645\" title=\"ZFC_EquivOn\">EquivOn</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"5b37d2d8ba4703a7\" href=\"?note=5b37d2d8ba4703a7\" title=\"ZFC_Subset\">Subset</a></p>\n<h2 id=\"证明状态\">证明状态</h2>\n<p>本页只定义缩写，不声称其一般元理论性质已经获得内核证明。 语言闭包检查与数学正确性验收的区别见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"593f9bdab4d60707\" href=\"?note=593f9bdab4d60707\" title=\"000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务\">000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"规范公式","text":"规范公式","level":2},{"id":"直接依赖","text":"直接依赖","level":2},{"id":"证明状态","text":"证明状态","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"000_ZFC/01_language","status":"resolved","id":"f625c6fc1945e22e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"规范公式","excerpt":"`(@ CSolve E)` 按 [[000_ZFC/01_language|无捕获缩写规则]] 展开为下列有限公式。参数只取集合，不能填入函数项或元语言公式。","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_CCompatible","status":"resolved","id":"1d04af639b3dad64","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_CCompatible|CCompatible]]；[[ZFC_CDependency|CDependency]]；[[ZFC_CNodes|CNodes]]；[[ZFC_ConverseWF|ConverseWF]]；[[ZFC_EquivOn|EquivOn]]；[[ZFC_Subset|Subset]]","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_CDependency","status":"resolved","id":"7fc9cbab4b5fcca5","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_CCompatible|CCompatible]]；[[ZFC_CDependency|CDependency]]；[[ZFC_CNodes|CNodes]]；[[ZFC_ConverseWF|ConverseWF]]；[[ZFC_EquivOn|EquivOn]]；[[ZFC_Subset|Subset]]","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_CNodes","status":"resolved","id":"76efdf35dc96e34a","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_CCompatible|CCompatible]]；[[ZFC_CDependency|CDependency]]；[[ZFC_CNodes|CNodes]]；[[ZFC_ConverseWF|ConverseWF]]；[[ZFC_EquivOn|EquivOn]]；[[ZFC_Subset|Subset]]","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_ConverseWF","status":"resolved","id":"3695560d61c84d4f","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_CCompatible|CCompatible]]；[[ZFC_CDependency|CDependency]]；[[ZFC_CNodes|CNodes]]；[[ZFC_ConverseWF|ConverseWF]]；[[ZFC_EquivOn|EquivOn]]；[[ZFC_Su